Package: vocotype-linux
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-yaml, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, ibus, fcitx5, libportaudio2, pkexec | policykit-1
Recommends: curl, python3-venv, libnotify-bin
Description: offline voice input for IBus and Fcitx 5
 VoCoType provides push-to-talk offline speech input, terminology handling,
 inverse text normalization, and optional AI polishing for Linux desktops.
 The package installs the desktop integration and opens a graphical setup
 workflow to create the per-user Python runtime and download models.
